---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/blog';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jarron Anthonipillai: software engineer building compilers, LLVM passes, simulations, and emulators.">
  <section class="border-b border-line/70 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="mb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">About the developer</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hi, I'm Jarron<span class="text-accent">.</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-9 text-muted">I'm a software engineer based in Toronto, with a University of Toronto BSc in Mathematics and Statistics. My recent work explores compilers, LLVM, low-level programming, and simulation architecture.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="grid gap-14 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr]">
    <div class="space-y-7 leading-8 text-muted">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What this site is for</h2>
      <p>I wanted a place where the work behind a project is as visible as the result. A README can explain what an application does; a technical journal can explain why I chose a recursive-descent parser, how a compiler pass preserves semantics, or what changes when autonomous workers have to reserve physical resources.</p>
      <p>My interests sit around compilers and language tooling, C++ systems programming, virtual machines, and simulation. Projects like <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href={sitePath('projects/microcc/')}>MicroCC</a>, <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href={sitePath('projects/optforge/')}>OptForge</a>, and <a class="text-accent hover:underline" href={sitePath('projects/ascii-universe/')}>ASCII Universe</a> give me practical ways to explore those topics.</p>
      <p>I aim to document design decisions, failures, tests, limitations, and improvements—not just polished milestones. Code and project links are included so the work is inspectable.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="space-y-5">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Background</p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-ink">BSc, Mathematics & Statistics</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">University of Toronto</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface/60 p-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Find me online</p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
          <a href="https://github.com/JarronAnt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink hover:text-accent">GitHub ↗</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jarronanthonipillai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ink hover:text-accent">LinkedIn ↗</a>
          <a href="mailto:jarronanthonipillai@gmail.com" class="text-ink hover:text-accent">Email ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
